        "text": "She says yes, she's probably staying for four months."
      },
      {
        "sequence_id": 4,
        "text": "She likes it very much in Munich."
      },
      {
        "sequence_id": 5,
        "text": "Mr. Becker asks her if she has something planned now and Miss Adams tells him that she'd like to go to the movies."
      },
