        "sequence_id": 6,
        "text": "Mr. Becker asks if he may come along and Miss Adams says she'd be glad to have him."
      },
      {
        "sequence_id": 7,
        "text": "Miss Adams points to Mr. and Mrs. Jones at the movies and asks Mr. Becker if he knows them."
      },
      {
        "sequence_id": 8,
        "text": "He says he doesn't know them and asks who they are."
      },
      {
        "sequence_id": 9,
        "text": "They are Americans."
      },
